349	     * The ceiling applied to this owner's derived {@code membershipLevel}: one above the highest
350	     * {@code membershipLevel} among the owner's household members (same last name and postcode) at
351	     * creation time. {@code null} when the owner had no existing household member, in which case no
352	     * cap applies.
353	     */
354	    public Integer getMembershipLevelCap() {
355	        return this.membershipLevelCap;
356	    }
